            "notes": "**Power: You have two excellent choices. Feel the Burn is generally preferred as the burn damage can secure kills on enemies who try to disengage with low health. Smashing is a strong alternative if you prefer to build momentum and stickiness in prolonged fights.**\n\n [Feeling the Burn](item_256f9e9c-c332-42f2-83d9-ad0d47e23399): Every 3rd Rocket Hammer swing applies Burn, dealing 30% Rocket Hammer damage over 2s.\n\n [Smashing!](item_a7021e28-cb8a-4f39-aeb1-380525b3fea9): When you deal damage with Rocket Hammer, gain 1% Move Speed and 3% Weapon Lifesteal for 2s, stacking up to 10 times.\n\n**Items: Purchase the following three common items.**\n\n[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0): +5% Weapon Power. Cost: 1,000 (Common).\n\n[Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318): +10% Weapon Lifesteal. Cost: 1,000 (Common).\n\n[Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf): +5% Attack Speed. Cost: 1,000 (Common).",
