            "notes": "**Power: Take the other power suggested in Round 1 either  [Feeling the Burn](item_256f9e9c-c332-42f2-83d9-ad0d47e23399) or  [Smashing!](item_a7021e28-cb8a-4f39-aeb1-380525b3fea9)** \n\n**Items: Sell any remaining common items. Your goal is to purchase  [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8)  and  [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36)** \n\n [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8): +5% Weapon Power, +10% Weapon Lifesteal. Cost: 4,500 (Rare).\n\n [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36):  +10% Attack Speed, +5% Ability Power. Cost: 4,000 (Rare).\n\nAlternative Items: Depending on the enemy team composition, you may need to substitute Wrist Wraps for a more defensive option.\n\n[Ironclad Cleats](item_afb5c28e-3980-4a7d-85be-785c32217c28): +25 Armor, +5% Weapon Power (Rocket Hammer), +40% Knockback Resist. Cost: 3,750 (Rare). (Excellent against heroes like  [Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85)  or  [Lucio](hero_b38c5d54-a585-4545-b0b8-4d4b205b3768)).\n\n[Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f): +25 Shields, -40% Incoming Negative Effect Duration. When affected by Stun, Sleep or Hinder, restore 10% of your max Life over 3s. Cost: 4,000 (Rare). (A strong choice against  [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000) or [Mei](hero_36fd67f0-19df-4c50-add9-709cfb147cb0)).",
